{% macro forecast_block(fc) %}
{% set a = fc.assumptions %}
- **Baseline**: {{ a.margin_source }} operating margin {{ pct(a.base_operating_margin * 100) }}; tax {{ pct(a.tax_rate * 100) }} ({{ a.tax_source }}); D&A {{ a.da_source }}; working capital {{ a.nwc_source }}
