{% macro risk_banner(risk) %}
{% set severe = risk.identified_risks | selectattr("severity", "equalto", "Severe") | list %}
> **Overall Risk Profile**: **{{ risk.overall_risk_profile }}** | **Severe Risks**: {{ severe | length }} of {{ risk.identified_risks | length }} | **Disclosure Baseline**: {{ ("vs FY" ~ risk.disclosure_changes.prior_fiscal_year) if risk.disclosure_changes else "not assessed" }}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro risk_matrix(risk) %}
{% if risk.data_quality.coverage_mode == "not_provided" %}
The filing's Item 1A discloses no risk factors (not applicable / smaller reporting company); no risks were rated.
{% else %}
{{ risk.risk_matrix_markdown }}

_Severity is a fixed likelihood × impact matrix computed in code; every risk is backed by a verbatim Item 1A quote._
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro risk_details(risk, level="###") %}
{% for r in risk.identified_risks %}
{{ level }} {{ r.risk_id }} — {{ r.risk_title }}
- **Disclosure**: {{ r.risk_summary }}
- **Quantified exposure**: {{ r.quantified_exposure or "None stated in the filing" }}
- **Filing-stated mitigation**: {{ r.mitigating_factors or "None stated in the filing" }}
- **Model lines hit**: {{ r.financial_transmission | join(", ") if r.financial_transmission else "n/a" }}
- **Signposts to monitor**: {{ r.monitoring_signposts | join("; ") if r.monitoring_signposts else "n/a" }}

{% endfor %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro disclosure_changes(risk) %}
{% if risk.disclosure_changes %}
{% set dc = risk.disclosure_changes %}
FY{{ dc.prior_fiscal_year }} baseline: {{ dc.new_sentences }} new, {{ dc.modified_sentences }} modified, {{ dc.unchanged_sentences }} unchanged and {{ dc.removed_sentences }} removed sentences ({{ dc.change_ratio_pct }}% of the current text new or modified).
{% else %}
No prior-year Item 1A was available, so year-over-year disclosure changes were not assessed.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro risk_audit_trail(risk) %}
{{ risk.evidence_table_markdown }}
{% if risk.data_quality.notes %}

**Risk analysis data-quality notes**
{% for note in risk.data_quality.notes %}
- {{ note }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if risk.data_quality.quantified_uncovered %}

**Quantified Item 1A disclosures not cited by any verified risk**
{% for text in risk.data_quality.quantified_uncovered %}
- "{{ text }}"
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro citations_table(citations) %}
{% if citations %}
| Chunk ID | Filing Section | Breadcrumb |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
{% for c in citations %}
| `{{ c.chunk_id }}` | {{ c.item or "—" }} | {{ c.breadcrumb or "—" }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No filing citations were recorded.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro footer(notes, provenance, removed) %}
{% if notes %}
**Data availability & pipeline notes**
{% for note in notes %}
- {{ note }}
{% endfor %}

